REF STATE 185729
METZGER ITINERARY IS AS FOLLOWS:
SEPTEMBER 21: DEPARTURE FOR WROCLAW FOR WARSAW;
SEPTEMBER 22: DEPARTURE WARSAW FOR NEW YORK AND ATLANTA;
SEPTEMBER 23-29: VISIT COMMUNICABLE DISEASE CENTER, ATLANTA;
SEPTEMBER 30: DEPARTURE FROM ATLANTA FOR HOUSTON;
SEPTEMBER 30-OCTOBER 1: VISIT DEPT OF MEDICAL MICROBIOLOGY,
UNIVERSITY OF HOUSTON, PROF. KNOX;
OCTOBER 2: DEPARTURE FROM HOUSTON FOR LOS ANGELES;
OCTOBER 2-9: VISIT MED. MICROBIOLOGY AND IMMUNOLOGY,
UNIVERSITY OF CALIFORNIA, PROF. JAMES N. MILLER;
OCTOBER 9: DEPARTURE FROM LOS ANGELES FOR BALTIMORE;
OCTOBER 9-11: VISIT DEPT OF MICROBIOLOGY, JOHNS HOPKINS
UNIVERSITY SCHOOL OF MEDICINE, PROF. PAUL H. HARDY;
OCTOBER 11: DEPARTURE FROM BALTIMORE FOR NEW YORK;
OCTOBER 11: DEPARTURE FROM NEW YORK FOR WARSAW AND WROCLAW.
DAVIS

