1.  SUBJECT CASE FOR HUNGARY 125675 UNDER ANALYSIS IN DEFENSE;
REQUIRES COCOM APPROVAL WHICH WILL REQUIRE ANOTHER SIX WEEKS.
2.  SZECHOSLOVAKIA CASES 124301 AND 130015 UNDER TECHNICAL
ANALYSIS IN OEA; ALSO REQUIRE DEFENSE AND COCOM CLEARANCES;
APPROVAL PROBABLY WITHIN SIX TO TEN WEEKS.
3.  CZECHOSLOVAKIA CASE 127835 UNDER ANALYSIS IN DEFENSE;
REQUIRES COCOM APPROVAL WHICH WILL MEAN ANOTHER SIX WEEKS.
4.  CZECH CASE 132676--LICENSE MAILED 27 NOVEMBER.
5.  CZECH CASE 123357 UNDER REVIEW; LICENSE MAY BE EXPECTED
WITHIN TEN DAYS. KISSINGER

